<span id="A1.T12.3.11.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_middle" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T12.3.11.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B</span>
